 "remarks": "OVersized multi level townhome in fabulous location with two garage spaces in the heart of downtown Stamford ! Kitchen with dishwasher/refrigerator/stove- formal dining area that opens into expansive living area w/ sliders to private deck! Large master bedroom with double closets, private deck, and full bathroom with tub. Generous sized second bedroom with ample closets- second bathroom. In unit washer/dryer! Enormous attic- great storage. Central air conditioning. Walk to train, shops, dining, minutes to highways and beaches! Add your finishing touches and have your dream home! Pets welcome!",
